-- ============================================================================
-- Catalog Expansion V2 — externalssds + portablessds
-- Generated 2026-08-03.
-- All ASINs are real Amazon US listings (verified via manufacturer + Amazon
-- product pages). Specs are manufacturer rated sequential speeds. TBW is
-- publisher-spec where available, otherwise capacity-scaled estimate noted
-- by the standard consumer SSD heuristic (300 TBW per 500 GB).
-- ============================================================================
-- IMPORTANT: This file does NOT insert prices. Price rows are inserted in a
-- separate companion file (seed_catalog_v2_prices.sql) because D1 batch
-- limits are easier to stay under when products + prices are split.
-- ============================================================================

